    <div id="root"><div class="bg-primary/10 border-b border-primary/20 text-foreground text-sm"><div class="container-page flex items-center gap-3 py-2"><span class="flex-1 truncate">Livraison offerte dès 60 000 DA — jusqu'à dimanche.</span><a class="shrink-0 rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90" href="./category/laptops">Découvrir</a><button aria-label="Fermer le bandeau" class="shrink-0 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="bg-announcement-bg text-announcement-fg marquee-viewport"><div class="marquee-track animate-marquee h-9 text-xs" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-group"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-6 text-announcement-fg/90"><span>🚚 Livraison rapide dans toutes les wilayas</span><span class="size-1 rounded-full bg-primary-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-6 text-announcement-fg/90"><span>✅ Garantie officielle sur tous les produits</span><span class="size-1 rounded-full bg-primary-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-6 text-announcement-fg/90"><span>🔧 Support technique 7j/7</span><span class="size-1 rounded-full bg-primary-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-6 text-announcement-fg/90"><span>💳 Paiement sécurisé à la livraison</span><span class="size-1 rounded-full bg-primary-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-6 text-announcement-fg/90"><span>🎁 Cadeau pour toute config au-dessus de 200 000 DA</span><span class