  </header><main class="pb-16 md:pb-0"><div class="animate-page-in"><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10" aria-hidden="true" style="background: var(--gradient-hero);"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, oklch(0.58 0.22 262 / 0.18), transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, oklch(0.68 0.22 262 / 0.12), transparent 50%);"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-[0.04]" aria-hidden="true" style="background-image: linear-gradient(oklch(0.62 0.19 255) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, oklch(0.62 0.19 255) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 48px 48px;"></div><div class="container-page flex flex-col items-center py-16 lg:py-24"><div class="space-y-6 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-medium animate-fade-in-up"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flame size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4"></path></svg> Collection 2026 disponible</span><h1 class="font-bold leading-[1.05] animate-fade-in-up delay-100" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);">La puissance tech,<br><span class="inline-block bg-clip-text text-transparent text-glow" style="background-image: var(--gradient-glow);">entre vos mains</span></h1><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto animate-fade-in-up delay-200">Les derniers ordinateurs portables, de bureau et téléphones aux meilleurs prix, avec garantie officielle et support technique dédié.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 animate-fade-in-up dela